# Recorded input for the toast example page (widgets/toast.zig, `Example`), at 800 x 600 in the
# default theme, 0.5 s per frame: Save at x 8..58, y 8..42; the toast, while shown, at
# x 338..462, y 551..584 (the bottom centre). It stays 3 s, paused while the pointer is on it,
# and fades over its last 0.3 s. One line per frame says what it does (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 800 600
dt 0.5
pointer 400 300
# 1: press Save
frame
pointer 33 25
buttons left
# 2: release: the toast shows, 3 s left
frame
buttons
# 3: 2.5 s left
frame
# 4: the pointer rests on the toast: paused at 2.5 s
frame
pointer 400 567
# 5: still paused
frame
# 6: the pointer leaves: 2 s
frame
pointer 400 300
# 7: 1.5 s
frame
# 8: 1 s
frame
# 9: 0.5 s
frame
# 10: a shorter frame: 0.1 s left, fading
frame
dt 0.4
# 11: gone
frame
